WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.380
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.960
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.170
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.470
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.560
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.720
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.720
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.730
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.060
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.320
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.900
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:34.910
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:47.450
<b>Gear Fourth</b>

31
00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.020
Run! Run!

32
00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:17.960
Run to the center of the island!

33
00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:41.460
Th-The buildings that haven't been sliced apart yet...

34
00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.890
...are being pushed by the cage and closing in on us!

35
00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.780
The country's growing smaller and smaller!

36
00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:01.130
<b>Royal Palace Grounds - Second Level</b>

37
00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.900
The bird cage is shrinking?

38
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.300
So that's what's causing all the commotion.

39
00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:14.000
This is the true terror of the bird cage, dear!

40
00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.300
I can't believe this!
This is a really big deal!

41
00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.870
Oh! I called him "dear" again!

42
00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:28.130
I can't just stand here and wait for death
while sucking my thumb!

43
00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.260
Rouse our fallen allies right away!

44
00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.390
Alright!

45
00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:37.920
<b>Former
Royal Plateau</b>

46
00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:38.210
If the battle lasts long enough,
this plateau will be cut into pieces, too.

47
00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:43.350
What?! I thought this was the center of the country!
Isn't this the safest place?

48
00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:44.480
Look at the sky!

49
00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.060
The center of the bird cage is shifting, little by little.

50
00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:56.850
The center of contraction is probably the current Royal Palace Grounds, where Doflamingo is!

51
00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:01.450
<b>Royal Palace Current Location</b>

52
00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.640
That means this place will eventually...

53
00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:09.760
Hurry up, Hack! Please hurry up!

54
00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.260
Stop shaking me!

55
00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:18.760
We have finally descended,
but there seems to be quite the commotion!

56
00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.460
That way, huh?

57
00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.140
Zoro-dono!

58
00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.550
Where are you going?

59
00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:28.740
It's obvious, isn't it?

60
00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.330
I'm going to stop it, of course!

61
00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.200
That!

62
00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.160
"That"?

63
00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.270
<b>Outside the Palace















Sunflower Field</b>

64
00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.760
What a surprise.

65
00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.800
I didn't know there were dwarfs in Dressrosa.

66
00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.380
I hope your arm is reconnected properly.

67
00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.740
They said when blood starts flowing, it's cured.

68
00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.740
I know. I'm a doctor.

69
00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:06.380
When I saw the underground trade port, I understood.

70
00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.710
This battle...

71
00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:17.380
Even if we do take down Doflamingo, it won't be over.

72
00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:22.020
It'll cause tremendous ripples across the world.

73
00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.580
And you guys will be the eye of the storm.

74
00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.760
Yeah.

75
00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.990
That's the plan.

76
00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.000
"Gear Fourth"?

77
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.060
That's right.

78
00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:15.600
Muscle Balloon!

79
00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.700
Gear...

80
00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.660
Fourth!

81
00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.460
Bound-Man!

82
00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:12.330
Whoa, whoa, is this some kind of joke?

83
00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.660
You've grown quite large.

84
00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:19.300
I thought you had an ace
up your sleeve or something...

85
00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:23.870
You can't even stand up straight,
being all rubber and bouncing like that.

86
00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:27.720
How're you gonna send me flying like that?

87
00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.780
For two years,

88
00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:36.980
I fought against monstrously huge, savage beasts!

89
00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.070
To force them into submission,

90
00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.800
I needed this giant body and bounciness!

91
00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:02.140
How will bounciness help you...

92
00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:07.960
Shut up!

93
00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:12.920
You won't...

94
00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.280
be able to do a damn thing!

95
00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:25.200
Rubber...

96
00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.970
Kong...

97
00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.280
Gun!

98
00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.190
I-It's Doflamingo!

99
00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.240
But why?

100
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.470
Back off, back off!

101
00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:26.580
Why are you here, Doflamingo?!

102
00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.640
That's what I'd like to know!

103
00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.910
Run! He's gonna kill us all!

104
00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:41.380
There's nowhere to run!
It's just the bird cage out there!

105
00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.790
Downtown, eh?

106
00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.740
I was flung pretty far...

107
00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:04.780
He's bouncing off the air!

108
00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:12.710
Rubber...

109
00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.040
Rhino Schneider!

110
00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.940
Somebody else came!

111
00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.900
He's huge! And he kicked Doflamingo away!

112
00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.520
Who is that ball-like guy?

113
00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.910
Dammit!

114
00:10:54.910 --> 00:11:01.830
By hardening his skin with the Color of Arms,
he's multiplied its tension!

115
00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:11.260
That ball bastard!
He's nothing but rubber!

116
00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:26.740
I told you!
You're no match for Gear Fourth!

117
00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:51.120
Rubber...

118
00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:57.360
Culverin!

119
00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.820
Athlete String!

120
00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.780
He's hardened, yet still rubbery?!

121
00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.570
Attacks like that...

122
00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:19.080
won't work!

123
00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:22.710
I can't believe this!

124
00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.770
You won't get away, Mingo!

125
00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.620
I'm gonna kick your ass!

126
00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.740
Why?! Now he just keeps stretching!

127
00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:38.360
Keep going after him, Python!

128
00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.260
Enough! Down you go!

129
00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.850
Rubber...

130
00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:54.650
Culverin!

131
00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.080
That rubber ball is...

132
00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.460
...overwhelming...

133
00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.970
...Doflamingo!

134
00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:04.160
Who is that guy?!

135
00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.730
Who cares who he is?!

136
00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:06.900
Go for it!

137
00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.070
You can do it!

138
00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:16.520
<b>Royal Palace Grounds</b>

139
00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.680
Did you see that?!

140
00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:16.750
Yeah...

141
00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:21.990
I can't believe how he changed.
Is that really Straw Hat?

142
00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:27.700
He's overpowering the formidable Doflamingo!
He's amazingly strong!

143
00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.850
But he's overusing his Haki.

144
00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:34.530
Overusing his... Haki?

145
00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.270
Oh, there he is.

146
00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.980
They went to play somewhere else.

147
00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.840
And here I took the trouble to come and watch them!

148
00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:53.320
Captain of the first ship of the
Blackbeard Pirates, Jesus Burgess.

149
00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:54.540
Why is he here?

150
00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.280
Chase 'em or wait for 'em...

151
00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.880
Either way, I won't let 'em get away!

152
00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:03.230
I'm gonna get what I came for!

153
00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:09.330
Just as I thought, he's after Luffy-kun and the others.

154
00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:10.690
But what's he really after?

155
00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:16.790
<b>Corrida Colosseum</b>

156
00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.140
Viola.

157
00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:20.510
So, all that remains is the decisive battle between him and Luffy-kun?

158
00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:22.700
Yes, that's right, Father.

159
00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.740
Of those ranked commander and above,

160
00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.310
Doflamingo is the only one remaining!

161
00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:31.540
<b>SMILE Factory</b>

162
00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:30.110
Outta the factory, Tontattas!

163
00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.450
Okay!

164
00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:37.880
We're outta here!
Get a super move on and get out!

165
00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:49.870
We've finished rescuing our stranded friends in the factory!

166
00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:51.970
Alright!

167
00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.130
The factory is tilting!

168
00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.260
Fraland! Why is the Smile Factory the only building that isn't being cut up?

169
00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.410
"Only" the factory?

170
00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.610
I get it, it's the Sea Stone!

171
00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.890
Sea Stone?

172
00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:17.140
Yeah, the outer walls of the factory are made of Sea Stone.

173
00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:22.360
So strings created by a Devil Fruit user can't cut it...

174
00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.960
But, look!

175
00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.610
It's starting to be pushed!

176
00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.560
Hm? That's...

177
00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:37.760
Franky!

178
00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.710
Oh, Robot-dono!

179
00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.920
Zoroland! Topknotland!

180
00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.780
Hey, Zoro, Kin'emon!

181
00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:52.330
The center of the country is in the direction you just flew from.

182
00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.190
If you wanna run, you're going the wrong way!

183
00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:58.940
We ain't running!
We're gonna stop the strings!

184
00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:02.530
Stop them?
Oh, I didn't even think about that!

185
00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:05.610
What?! That's so cool!

186
00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:10.090
Until Luffy settles this, we gotta buy some time!

187
00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:14.530
Oh yeah!

188
00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:20.240
<b>Downtown
Luffy vs. Doflamingo</b>

189
00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:39.510
Using the Color of Arms to control the expansion and contraction of his rubber body any way he wants...

190
00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:47.150
A harmony of Arming and Rubber, huh?

191
00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:59.910
If I take too much time, Gear Fourth's gonna...

192
00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:08.630
You seem like you have excellent grasp of your abilities, but it must be quite the burden.

193
00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:11.480
Surely there are some risks.

194
00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.150
Rubber...

195
00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:18.040
Straw Hat, how many more
seconds will you last?

196
00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:19.010
...Double...

197
00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:25.340
My strings, however, will never run out!

198
00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.060
...Culverin!

199
00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:28.390
Off-White String!

200
00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.990
H-How are his strings
coming out of the ground?!

201
00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.250
What did you do to this town?!

202
00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.170
Listen up, fledgling!

203
00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:51.980
Devil Fruit abilities have yet another stage to them, called "Awakening"!

204
00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.540
The buildings turned into strings!

205
00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:10.430
In rare instances, an ability will "awaken"
and begin to affect things other than its user's body!

206
00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:16.750
All kinds of things are turning into strings!
This doesn't look like the power of a Paramecia!

207
00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:20.550
Anything that surrounds you, I can turn to string!

208
00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:25.970
You can't even come near me!

209
00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:40.750
And when your strength gives out,
my body will have...

210
00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:12.190
The moment your Haki gives out, I'll finish you off!

211
00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:18.800
<b>20 Minutes
Later</b>

212
00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.750
It's gonna slice us! Run!

213
00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:31.620
Oh, Grandma!

214
00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:35.630
Grandma, stand up! The strings'll cut you!

215
00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.370
I can't...

216
00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.810
I can't run anymore...

217
00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:47.750
Leave me here and go on ahead.

218
00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:50.830
No way, no way! I can't do something like that!

219
00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:56.000
I won't survive this anyway.

220
00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.820
Please, get up!

221
00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:03.350
Even if I get up,
I definitely can't run all the way downtown!

222
00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:10.300
Somebody, give us a hand!

223
00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:13.020
There are still patients in the hospital!

224
00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:15.370
We can't carry them all by ourselves! I'm begging you!

225
00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:21.500
My son's missing! Has anyone seen him?!

226
00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:24.990
He's wearing a Kuma shirt! He's five years old!

227
00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.970
Anybody! Have you seen my son?!

228
00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:36.170
We're all gonna die anyway.

229
00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:38.530
We should just give up.

230
00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:43.550
No matter how far we run, we're still in a cage.

231
00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:45.750
We'll all be killed by Doflamingo.

232
00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:48.010
It's easier...

233
00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.870
if we just give up.

234
00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:13.510
Everybody, please listen to me.

235
00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.790
This is...

236
00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:20.200
the former king of Dressrosa, Riku Dold the Third.

237
00:22:23.260 --> 00:22:24.650
Wh-What?

238
00:22:25.270 --> 00:22:27.090
K-King Riku...

239
00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:35.630
Currently, our country is trapped within an inescapable bird cage,

240
00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:39.070
as part of a game started by the current king, Doflamingo.

241
00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:47.070
In addition, that vicious bird cage continues to shrink, carving up the town with it.

242
00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:53.560
King Riku...

243
00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:56.310
All too suddenly, reality befell all of you.

244
00:22:57.390 --> 00:23:00.370
I am sure your emotions have not had the chance to catch up to you,

245
00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:05.850
and right now you are simply trying to save your own life, or the life of someone else!

246
00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:10.850
However, this is not a dream!

247
00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:14.450
Nor is this a tragedy that has begun only today!

248
00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:17.680
For a decade,

249
00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:22.490
we have lived in this bird cage called "Dressrosa",

250
00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:24.890
under the reign of pirates!

251
00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:37.810
For a decade, we lived as puppets manipulated by them.

252
00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:41.010
Such is our reality!

253
00:23:41.930 --> 00:23:44.390
However, that shall soon end!

254
00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:50.420
The Donquixote Family that we thought nobody could match...

255
00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:55.150
...is on the verge of defeat, at the hands of the mighty warriors

256
00:23:55.150 --> 00:23:57.470
that are in this country by coincidence!

257
00:23:57.470 --> 00:24:00.440
The Family's commanders have already fallen!

258
00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:01.480
Really?!

259
00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:03.670
Those commanders were...

260
00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:05.650
He's saying they were taken down?

261
00:24:05.650 --> 00:24:08.430
The only enemy remaining to be defeated...

262
00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:12.890
is the current king of Dressrosa, Doflamingo!

263
00:24:23.850 --> 00:24:28.210
And the one fighting him is the pirate, Straw Hat Luffy!

264
00:24:28.910 --> 00:24:33.610
I believe that he is the man
that will destroy this bird cage!

265
00:24:34.950 --> 00:24:39.290
Whether he wins or loses,
it will be over in less than an hour!

266
00:24:39.290 --> 00:24:42.990
Until then, survive! Do whatever it takes!

267
00:24:43.790 --> 00:24:49.430
I do not want a single one of you to be crushed by this shrinking country!

268
00:24:49.430 --> 00:24:51.610
Please, keep running!

269
00:24:52.110 --> 00:24:56.190
Even if you run out of breath, or if your legs break!

270
00:24:56.190 --> 00:25:00.270
Stay alive for just a few more minutes!

271
00:25:07.810 --> 00:25:10.080
There is still hope!

272
00:25:10.080 --> 00:25:12.810
Please don't give up!

273
00:25:20.780 --> 00:25:22.840
We'll give it our all, even without help!

274
00:25:23.750 --> 00:25:24.620
Okay!

275
00:25:24.620 --> 00:25:27.130
Alright! Let's get goin', grandkid!

276
00:25:33.610 --> 00:25:35.550
'Kay, Grandma!

277
00:25:36.090 --> 00:25:37.130
Me, too!

278
00:25:38.280 --> 00:25:40.400
Just like King Riku said...

279
00:25:40.400 --> 00:25:43.390
We won't give up! We're running downtown!

280
00:25:43.390 --> 00:25:44.950
Carry the sick!

281
00:25:44.950 --> 00:25:46.050
Grab those beds!

282
00:25:57.850 --> 00:25:59.770
Mommy!

283
00:26:03.710 --> 00:26:07.210
Survive until the battle ends!

284
00:26:07.210 --> 00:26:11.780
Straw Hat Luffy's gonna take down Doflamingo for us!

285
00:26:11.780 --> 00:26:12.460
Uh-huh!

286
00:26:18.270 --> 00:26:20.090
Mingo!

287
00:26:25.270 --> 00:26:27.530
About time you dropped dead.

288
00:26:30.110 --> 00:26:31.800
I'm runnin' out of time!

289
00:26:31.800 --> 00:26:33.450
The whole town's turning to string!

290
00:26:34.650 --> 00:26:36.570
Billow White!

291
00:26:47.210 --> 00:26:49.690
Mingo!

292
00:26:55.470 --> 00:26:57.490
I'm gonna blow you away!

293
00:27:16.140 --> 00:27:18.520
Mingo!

294
00:27:24.760 --> 00:27:26.760
I'm ending this!

295
00:27:29.160 --> 00:27:31.960
Rubber...

296
00:27:38.940 --> 00:27:41.080
Leo Bazooka!

297
00:28:14.780 --> 00:28:17.000
D-Do...

298
00:28:18.480 --> 00:28:19.980
Doflamingo!
